  "extraction_notes": "[text-pass] The article focuses on re-analyzing experimental data from Zhang et al. (2022) using the SPB model. Specific thermoelectric property values (other than the ZT of 2.3 at 673 K) are presented as trends in plots (Figs 2-6) rather than discrete numerical tables, so they were not extracted as individual data points per the instructions. [figure-pass p1-5] The provided pages contain plots of Hall mobility vs temperature (Fig 1) and Seebeck coefficient vs carrier concentration (Fig 2a), but no plots of Seebeck coefficient, electrical conductivity, thermal conductivity, lattice thermal conductivity, power factor, or ZT as a function of temperature were found. Therefore, no thermoelectric property values were extracted. [figure-pass p6-10] Thermoelectric properties (PF and ZT) were extracted from Fig. 6(d) and 6(f) at 570 K for various compositions. Values are visual estimates from the plots. [figure-pass p11-12] The provided pages contain electronic band structure plots (Fig. 7) and a list of references, but no thermoelectric property-vs-temperature plots or tables for AgSbTe2-family compounds. ",
